From 1a71767845e4c73568c56cfac7ead2c7306aa758 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: arena-agent <arena-agent@local>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:50:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Repair: restore erased MainActivity, wire backup-models UI
 for real, plain-words brain-failure verdicts

- MainActivity.kt was emptied to a 13-byte placeholder (SEE_ARTIFACTS) by
  041c630; no build has succeeded since. Restored from fa141c7 (793 lines).
- 945bc44 claimed to wire the rotation-models settings field but changed one
  line of the placeholder. The field is now actually added: draft state,
  dialog UI (Backup models), Test + Save wiring, persistence already present.
- Gateway rotation is now visible: onRotated updates the model status line.
- The app used to answer brain failures with a file-marker scan and no plain
  explanation. Failure answers now lead with 'I could not reach the AI brain'
  and label local checks as NOT the answer.
- Added 404/model-retired explanations to ModelFailure.humanize and
  ModelConnectionProbe.explainProviderError.
- README: replaced retired llama-3.3-70b-versatile (dead since 2026-08-16)
  with verified-free openai/gpt-oss-120b (+20b backup).
